        -- Resizing Clusters in Amazon Redshift
        -- in the Amazon Redshift Cluster Management Guide.
        -- Valid Values:
        -- dc2.large | dc2.8xlarge |
        -- ra3.large | ra3.xlplus | ra3.4xlarge | ra3.16xlarge
